  "data": {
    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Doubles Event Companion",
    "summary": "Force means the two partners’ armies taken together. A Unified Force requires identical sets of faction keywords across those armies. Adeptus Astartes forces can qualify as a Unified Force even if their units have different Chapter keywords. Classify every other force as a Force of Convenience.\n\nDesigner’s Note. Leave allied units out when classifying a force. For example, omit an IMPERIAL KNIGHTS unit taken as an ally by an IMPERIUM army. Apply the Unified Force test to the rest, then use Force of Convenience if it fails.",
